      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "1c68f100-45c3-48d8-ac16-8d223aa7793a",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "2347d276-2821-4942-a294-a93062bee3e6",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "81018d0f-14bf-43ae-a784-dff9c4711d2c",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "After routing the\nintact crate\nthrough the\nsuitable gate, how\nmany weight units",
                      "of capacity remain\non that crossing?\nThe limits are\nmaximum loads, not\ntargets that must",
                      "be filled. Moxie\nwants to know\nwhether a one-unit\nhand tool bag can\naccompany the",
                      "crate without\nbreaking the\nlimit. Count the",
                      "crate first, then\nfind the remaining\nmargin."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "0bd676ae-9ceb-46dc-abb1-2128ed767cb6",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
